142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115154","id":3988342142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tuUV-","user":{"login":"wagnerfs","id":106078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjA3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs","html_url":"https://github.com/wagnerfs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-03T03:10:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T03:14:15Z","body":"I gotta add to this post, I found out something REALLY weird about the issue, it does NOT happen if the `FogVolume`'s rotation is actually `camera_3d.rotation.y - deg_to_rad(46)`.\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b95a0df9-3eab-455a-b2a6-c872f4e6041f\" />\n\nBugs out at an angle\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da84c000-c514-4298-a225-9d9099df1999\" />\n\nBut when rotated following the logic above:\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01e5dadc-06d8-4b5b-9ded-9e3e2c4be78d\" />\n\nSo the bug might have something to do with transforms.\n\nI also found out that increasing the camera near cull boundary to like, 0.3 ~ 0.5 also fix the issue, which is crazy since it should be the opposite.\n\nHere's the project for testing:\n[FogVolumeCullBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25701487/FogVolumeCullBug.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3988342142/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5940873722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115154#issuecomment-5940873722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115154","id":5940873722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYhqJ-g","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T21:21:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T21:22:59Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.8.dev c87ba5814 (Linux).\n\n> Godot v4.8.dev (c87ba5814) - Fedora Linux 44 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor (3840x2160 @ 240.02 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 615.71.09) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nCurrent | Expected\n-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f8f2d0a-a5ee-4d3c-bb07-851a56a338a8\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f63699db-b6b1-45c9-a711-388dade225cc\" />\n\nThis occurs regardless of volume size/depth and temporal reprojection. Here it is with volume size/depth both set to 128 and temporal reprojection disabled. The FogVolume's size is 16×1×1.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27720537-3af9-466f-87a3-bada75ade564\n\n**Testing project:** [test_volumetric_fog_banding.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32935301/test_volumetric_fog_banding.zip)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5940873722/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]